WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:05,030
You are really cautious

2
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:07,530
I've done everything you said

3
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:09,530
Finished your enemy

4
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:12,030
Isn't this enough to win your trust?

5
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:16,060
Those people are also a huge threat to you

6
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:18,560
You didn't get rid of them entirely because of me

7
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:21,820
You also have needs to survive

8
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,320
get rid of them

9
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,320
Just prove that you have some effect

10
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,820
Meets the basic requirements to be my helper

11
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:29,550
But then

12
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:31,740
You have to prove your harmlessness

13
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,740
So what exactly do you want me to do?

14
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:37,730
Only then can you believe that I am harmless to you

15
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:40,730
You don't have any weapons hidden on your body, do you?

16
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:44,470
Look at me like this

17
00:00:44,470 --> 00:00:46,970
There can't be any dangerous weapons hidden there, right?
